  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Irrigation Restoration and Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Project Development Objective is to increase agriculture productivity and production in the project areas.  The strategy for achieving the PDO would include:  br  (i)	assisting local communities/farmers to rehabilitate irrigation schemes;  br  (ii)	re-establishing hydro-meteorological services in the country to provide improved access to hydro-met data to enable preparation of improved and more cost effective designs of rehabilitation and development works; and  br  (iii)	continuing capacity building in MEW for preparing and implementing irrigation/ water resource development projects.</narrative>
  </description>
